  "question": "Find the work done, in joules, when $2$ mol of an ideal gas expand isothermally at $300$ K from $10$ L to $20$ L. ($R = 8.3$ J/mol K, $\\ln 2 = 0.693$; give the answer to the nearest whole number)",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [],
  "answer": "",
  "numerical_answer": "3451",
  "tolerance": "0",
  "solution": "$$W = nRT\\ln\\frac{V_2}{V_1} = 2 \\times 8.3 \\times 300 \\times 0.693 \\approx 3451\\ \\text{J}$$",
